COMPLETE ORDER WORKFLOW (Text-Based)
ORDER WORKFLOW FOR PET SHOP ADMIN
==================================

STAGE 1: ORDER PLACEMENT
├─→ Customer places order on website
├─→ Order created with status: "PENDING PAYMENT"
├─→ Order ID generated (e.g., #PS-2024-00001)
├─→ Notification sent to: Admin Email, Admin Dashboard
└─→ Inventory: Items marked as "RESERVED" (not deducted yet)

↓

STAGE 2: PAYMENT VERIFICATION
├─→ Admin checks payment status in Orders > Pending
├─→ IF payment method = COD:
│   ├─→ Admin verifies customer phone/address
│   └─→ Manual status update to "PAYMENT CONFIRMED"
├─→ IF payment method = Online (Stripe/PayPal):
│   ├─→ Auto-verification via webhook
│   └─→ Auto-update to "PAYMENT CONFIRMED"
├─→ IF payment fails:
│   ├─→ Status remains "PENDING PAYMENT"
│   ├─→ Auto-reminder email sent after 24 hours
│   └─→ Auto-cancel after 48 hours → Inventory unreserved
└─→ Inventory: Stock deducted from available quantity

↓

STAGE 3: ORDER PROCESSING
├─→ Status updated to: "PROCESSING"
├─→ Admin assigns order to warehouse/staff member
├─→ IF order contains PETS:
│   ├─→ Verify pet health certificate is valid
│   ├─→ Check vaccination records are up-to-date
│   ├─→ Prepare pet transfer documents
│   ├─→ Generate health certificate for customer
│   └─→ Notify pet care team for preparation
├─→ IF order contains PRODUCTS only:
│   ├─→ Pick items from inventory
│   └─→ Quality check
├─→ Generate packing slip
├─→ Print invoice
├─→ Update order notes with picker name and time
└─→ Notification sent to: Customer (Email/SMS)

↓

STAGE 4: PACKING
├─→ Status updated to: "PACKED"
├─→ Items packed according to type:
│   ├─→ Live Pets: Special carriers with ventilation
│   ├─→ Fish: Water-filled bags with oxygen
│   ├─→ Food: Check expiry dates
│   └─→ Fragile items: Bubble wrap
├─→ Attach shipping label
├─→ IF pet order:
│   └─→ Attach all documents to package:
│       ├─→ Health certificate
│       ├─→ Vaccination record copy
│       ├─→ Care instructions
│       └─→ Pet transfer form
├─→ Upload package photos (proof of packing)
└─→ Notification sent to: Customer

↓

STAGE 5: SHIPPING
├─→ Status updated to: "SHIPPED"
├─→ Select shipping carrier:
│   ├─→ For Pets: Priority/Express shipping only
│   └─→ For Products: Standard/Express options
├─→ Admin enters:
│   ├─→ Carrier name
│   ├─→ Tracking number
│   ├─→ Estimated delivery date
│   └─→ Shipping date/time
├─→ IF pet shipment:
│   ├─→ Driver/Delivery person receives special instructions
│   └─→ Customer receives emergency contact number
├─→ Tracking link auto-generated
├─→ Email/SMS sent to customer with tracking details
├─→ Order timeline updated with shipping info
└─→ Real-time tracking status synced (if integrated)

↓

STAGE 6: OUT FOR DELIVERY
├─→ Status updated to: "OUT FOR DELIVERY"
├─→ SMS/Push notification sent to customer
├─→ IF pet delivery:
│   └─→ Delivery person calls customer 30 mins before arrival
└─→ Admin monitors delivery status

↓

STAGE 7: DELIVERY ATTEMPT
├─→ IF successful delivery:
│   ├─→ Customer signs for receipt (digital/physical)
│   ├─→ IF pet delivery:
│   │   ├─→ Customer inspects pet health
│   │   ├─→ Signs pet transfer form
│   │   └─→ Photos taken as proof
│   ├─→ Delivery proof uploaded (signature, photo)
│   ├─→ Status: "DELIVERED"
│   ├─→ Payment released to merchant (if escrow)
│   ├─→ Notification to admin and customer
│   └─→ Auto-email: Review request sent after 24 hours
│
├─→ IF delivery failed:
│   ├─→ Status: "DELIVERY FAILED"
│   ├─→ Reason logged (Customer not home, wrong address, etc.)
│   ├─→ Admin notified
│   ├─→ Admin contacts customer to reschedule
│   ├─→ Reattempt scheduled
│   └─→ IF 3 failed attempts → Return to origin
│
└─→ IF pet delivery failed:
    ├─→ Immediate admin alert (pets need immediate care)
    ├─→ Pet returned to store/facility
    └─→ Customer contacted for resolution

↓

STAGE 8: POST-DELIVERY
├─→ Order marked: "COMPLETED"
├─→ IF pet order:
│   ├─→ Follow-up call after 24 hours (pet wellness check)
│   ├─→ Follow-up email with care tips
│   └─→ Schedule vaccination reminders (stored in system)
├─→ Review request email sent
├─→ Loyalty points credited (if applicable)
├─→ Order archived after 30 days
└─→ Analytics updated (revenue, customer lifetime value, etc.)

↓

ALTERNATIVE PATHS
==================

CANCELLATION FLOW:
├─→ Customer/Admin initiates cancellation
├─→ IF before "SHIPPED": Full refund eligible
├─→ IF after "SHIPPED": Partial refund (shipping cost deducted)
├─→ Status: "CANCELLED"
├─→ IF payment received: Refund initiated
├─→ Inventory: Stock returned to available
├─→ Refund timeline: 5-7 business days
└─→ Cancellation reason logged for analytics

RETURN/REFUND FLOW:
├─→ Customer requests return (within return window, e.g., 7 days)
├─→ NOTE: Live pets typically non-returnable (except health issues)
├─→ Admin reviews request in Orders > Returns section
├─→ IF approved:
│   ├─→ Return shipping label generated
│   ├─→ Customer ships item back
│   ├─→ Admin receives and inspects item
│   ├─→ IF condition acceptable:
│   │   ├─→ Refund processed
│   │   └─→ Stock returned to inventory
│   └─→ IF condition not acceptable:
│       ├─→ Refund denied with reason
│       └─→ Item returned to customer (at their cost)
├─→ Status: "REFUNDED"
└─→ Timeline: Return received → Inspected → Refund issued (3-5 days)

EXCHANGE FLOW:
├─→ Customer requests exchange
├─→ Admin creates exchange order linked to original
├─→ Original order status: "EXCHANGE REQUESTED"
├─→ New order created with: "EXCHANGE ORDER"
├─→ Return process same as above
├─→ Once return received and approved:
│   ├─→ New item shipped
│   └─→ Price difference charged/refunded if applicable

ORDER STATUS DEFINITIONS

PENDING PAYMENT - Order placed, awaiting payment confirmation
PAYMENT CONFIRMED - Payment received and verified
PROCESSING - Order being prepared, items being picked
PACKED - Items packed and ready for shipment
SHIPPED - Package handed to carrier, in transit
OUT FOR DELIVERY - With local delivery agent
DELIVERED - Successfully delivered to customer
COMPLETED - Order fulfilled, no further action needed
CANCELLED - Order cancelled by customer/admin
REFUNDED - Payment returned to customer
DELIVERY FAILED - Delivery attempt unsuccessful
EXCHANGE REQUESTED - Customer wants to exchange item
RETURNED - Item returned by customer


